<p>Activate to Seal Fate for 5 turns.  When you damage a target while Seal Fate is active you gain Spin and have a <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">4%, 19%, 27%, 32%, 36%</acronym> chance to increase the duration of one detrimental status effect on it by one turn.</p><p>If you have Spin Fate active the chance will be increased by 33% per Spin (for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">8%, 38%, 55%, 65%, 72%</acronym> at three Spin.)</p><p>The duration increase can occur up to <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">1, 2, 3, 4, 5</acronym> times per turn and the bonus Spin once per turn.</p>